  "question": "设 $D = \\left| \\begin{array}{cccc}a_{1} & a_{2} & a_{3} & a_{4}\\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1\\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5\\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = 9$ ， $A_{ij}$ 为元素 $a_{ij}$ 的代数余子式，求 $A_{21} + A_{22}$",
  "answer": "$$ A _ {2 1} + A _ {2 2} = \\left| \\begin{array}{c c c c} 0 & 0 & 0 & - 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = 6. $$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "按行按列展开",
    "矩阵运算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 一种思考方式是按行列式的展开定理 $A_{21} + A_{22} = \\left| \\begin{array}{cccc}a_1 & a_2 & a_3 & a_4\\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 0\\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5\\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right|$ ，只需确定出第1行的常数；另一种思考方式是改变行列式 $D$ 的第2行，再按第2行展开求解."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "方法1 取 $a_1 = a_2 = a_3 = 0$ ，得\n\n$$\n9 = \\left| \\begin{array}{l l l l} 0 & 0 & 0 & a _ {4} \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = - a _ {4} \\left| \\begin{array}{l l l} 2 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = - 3 a _ {4} \\Rightarrow a _ {4} = - 3.\n$$\n\n所以\n\n$$\nA _ {2 1} + A _ {2 2} = \\left| \\begin{array}{c c c c} 0 & 0 & 0 & - 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = 6.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "方法2 将 $D$ 按第2行展开得\n\n$$\n2 A _ {2 1} + 2 A _ {2 2} + A _ {2 3} + A _ {2 4} = 9.\\tag{①}\n$$\n\n又\n\n$$\n\\left| \\begin{array}{c c c c} a _ {1} & a _ {2} & a _ {3} & a _ {4} \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = 0 \\Rightarrow A _ {2 1} + A _ {2 2} + 2 A _ {2 3} + 2 A _ {2 4} = 0.\\tag{②}\n$$\n\n①，②式联立解出 $A_{21} + A_{22} = 6$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$$ A _ {2 1} + A _ {2 2} = \\left| \\begin{array}{c c c c} 0 & 0 & 0 & - 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{array} \\right| = 6. $$",
